  "notes": [
    "The order page is ZRANGE over the user's bought_at index, then one pipelined HGETALL per order: two round trips. The detail is three (user + first order, its item index, the items).",
    "Holds the whole dataset in memory; there is no cache budget to equalise. A restart replays the append-only file, so the phases after it read a resident dataset, not a cold one.",
